00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.330
vectors u and v have the same
number of components.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:23.310
And what they do, their dot
product comes from multiplying

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:27.170
the first component in u with
the first component in v.

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:29.420
That's u1, v1,

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:38.450
plus the second component in u
times the second component in v,

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:45.050
plus all the way through the
last component in u times the

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:48.050
